    "result_text": "I agree with the finding and addressed it.\n\n**Change made:** Region knowledge is now single-sourced. I added `Regions.isKnownRegion(String)`, backed by the existing `REGION_TIMEZONE` map (the same table that already authoritatively enumerates NSW/VIC/QLD), and `OwnerSegment.of` now calls it instead of carrying its own `Set.of(\"NSW\", \"VIC\", \"QLD\")`. Adding a fourth region later is now a single edit in `Regions`, consistent with the codebase's existing discipline (`Regions.UNKNOWN` \u2192 `CustomerCode.UNKNOWN_REGION`, the `format`/`region` matched pair).\n\n`OwnerSegment` keeps what's genuinely its own: the `PREMIUM_FROM` tier threshold and the `<TIER>_<AREA>` formatting.\n\nTests remain green: `BUILD SUCCESS`, both acceptance tests pass (`STANDARD_METRO` and `STANDARD_REGIONAL`).",
